From ba2309a7e9cb351848b74d65e67ec96eea1b9e80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Aug 2024 19:48:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/53] swdtb: add l2cache cache-line-size and interrupt (#100)

1. swdtb: l2cache: add cache-line-size from d-cache-line-size in CPU
2. swdtb: l2cache: add interrupt-parent and interrupts to l2cache node

*Add cache-line-size from d-cache-line-size in CPU:
This fix will read the d-cache-line-size from the CPU node and
add the cache-line-size property to the l2cache node.

Example: in AX45MP
    "NONE"
==>
    "cache-line-size = <0x40>;"

*Add interrupt-parent and interrupts to l2cache node:
Add the interrupt-parent and interrupts properties to the l2cache node.
This involves specifying the parent interrupt controller and defining
the interrupt source for the L2 cache

Example: in l2cache node
    "NONE"
==>
    interrupts = <0x10 0x04>;
    interrupt-parent = <0x06>;

Signed-off-by: Randolph randolph@andestech.com
Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/100
